Z||000042||batboy||05-08-2000||02:02 PM||||By the way, this topic has been fun, but time to set the record straight. I got quite a thrill from a cute girl in a nice Fiero waving at me, a little harmless flirting. But, she had out-of-state plates on the car, appeared about college age, and exited at one of the Washburn University off-ramps. Chances are good she's a co-ed. That means she's half my age. End of story! End of fantasy! Sorry to disappoint you guys, but I'm not going to be "pursuing" anyone. Way too young and I'm not rich! Also, too many times of having my ego bruised and self-esteem ground into dust under a high-heel of women my own age.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
